      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Changing the overall study framing to be exploratory or case-study oriented is a significant revision that requires thorough editing across the entire paper. You cannot simply swap terminology; the discussion, introduction, and conclusions must align with this new design philosophy. While positioning the small $N$ as an asset in a highly controlled design is possible, completely omitting any discussion of scope can sometimes raise suspicion with cautious reviewers.",
